Quick build with online model

  Create a cloud account with an AI provider (GCP, OpenAI, etc.)
  Create a Messaging account (Telegram, Whatsapp, etc.)
  Pre-install OpenClaw dependencies (Node.js, npm)
  Install OpenClaw
  Complete configuration (Model, Connector)
  System Prompt
  Complete Connector

Full build with local model

  Create a cloud account with an AI provider (GCP, OpenAI, etc.)
  Create a Messaging account (Telegram, Whatsapp, etc.)
  Install LMStudio and download model (google – gemma-4-e4b)
  Start LMS Server
  Pre-install OpenClaw dependencies (Node.js, npm)
  Install OpenClaw
  Complete configuration (Model - connect to LMStudio Server, Connector)
  System Prompt
  Complete Connector
